---
description: Next.js website
globs: apps/web/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Website first, mobile-friendly (responsive). Designs are phone-sized; they must also work on desktop.
- Route groups: (contractor) and (client). Client screens show verified data only.
- All API calls go through lib/api.ts
- Money displayed as ₹ with lakh/crore formatting. Dates DD/MM/YYYY.
- No calculations in components. Show numbers the API returns.
- Every number shown should be tappable to its source document when the API provides it
- Follow the designs in docs/design/ when present
